Description: Install autopppd straight into examples/scripts/
 override_dh_installexamples-arch ran `dh_installexamples` and then
 moved `examples/autopppd` to `examples/scripts/`, assuming the helper
 had placed both `debian/extra/autopppd` and the upstream `scripts/`
 dir under `usr/share/doc/ppp/examples/`.  Under our snapshot's
 debhelper neither happens — `dh_installexamples` silently skips every
 entry in `debian/ppp.examples`, so `examples/` is never populated and
 the subsequent `mv` aborts with "cannot stat examples/autopppd".
 .
 Replace the `mv` with `install -D` that creates the parent directory
 and copies `debian/extra/autopppd` to its final destination directly,
 with no dependence on whatever `dh_installexamples` did or didn't do
 with the same source path.
Author: Harkirat S Virk <harkiratsvirk@gmail.com>
Origin: local
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-05-20
---
This patch header follows DEP-3: http://dep.debian.net/deps/dep3/
--- a/debian/rules
+++ b/debian/rules
@@ -113,9 +113,12 @@
 override_dh_installexamples-arch:
 	dh_installexamples

-	# use our own version, not the upstream one
-	mv $(DIR_PPP)/usr/share/doc/ppp/examples/autopppd \
-		$(DIR_PPP)/usr/share/doc/ppp/examples/scripts/
+	# use our own version, not the upstream one.  `-D` creates
+	# examples/scripts/ since dh_installexamples doesn't populate it
+	# under our debhelper (file/dir entries in ppp.examples appear to be
+	# silently skipped), and overwrites the upstream copy if present.
+	install -D -p -m 555 debian/extra/autopppd \
+		$(DIR_PPP)/usr/share/doc/ppp/examples/scripts/autopppd

 override_dh_lintian:
 	dh_lintian
